version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
keywords:
  - model compilation
  - quantization-aware training
  - knowledge distillation
  - selective prediction
  - certified deferral
  - byte-level encoder
abstract: >-
  A build pipeline that distills a tiny byte-level task model from a one-line spec, trains it
  quantization-aware at 2/3/4 bit, certifies a deferral threshold on the exact integer kernel that
  ships, and links the weights into a native binary as a read-only constant array. Released with
  the trained student checkpoints and two fine-tuned ModernBERT toxicity classifiers. The research
  project was concluded without a publication; code and checkpoints are released as-is.
